 <profile id="325e78f8-af80-5db8-9b41-8d5a2ea89123" name="Astartes Crew" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">All Crew count as Legiones Astartes (+1), free; may commit up to full current Crew in a Hull Assault, keeping 1 aboard.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 </profiles>
 <rules><rule id="21f09eb2-4ec7-5d6b-a358-94394dbd7ea8" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Twin Lance Turret resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="eb6b9203-765e-5727-bb57-8f531217b547" name="Capital" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="3af2f4f5-f8c9-50f9-9cad-400b370609f0" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="ae97706a-feac-50df-9c94-d8a52cb02e31" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="993beffb-1a84-5672-9d41-a38b153c5c40" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="fced4b56-3d7a-5d34-9836-d29398ddb2f7" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="da54c25a-6db3-52f3-aa2a-45582d6ce570" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="fb404fd3-7b63-59de-a227-d58e21c706b8" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="8b90ed70-086d-5adf-853e-134fcf044137" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="099ae9b4-af91-546a-9f23-81686c1e1c13" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="f7d6fc79-1ba7-5793-b389-054387c5fc66" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="7d67f26b-a5b8-5c11-a665-4d7c0a54e364" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="49eb430d-973c-5239-9719-1e2d58da536d" name="Capital" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="true" />
 </categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
